Meta{format:TOON_v2.1.0,project:Request-Website-v2.0,document:REQUEST_SETUP,updated:2026-02-08}:

StackOverview{summary}:
- App:Next.js_App_Router(prismic-next)
- CMS:Prismic(repo=request)
- Models:Slice_Machine(local_models_sync_to_Prismic)
- Hosting:Vercel(root_dir=prismic-next)
- Previews:/api/preview(local+cloud)
- Webhook:/api/revalidate(optional)

KeyPaths{locations}:
- AppRoot:prismic-next/
- PrismicClient:prismic-next/src/prismicio.ts
- SliceModels:prismic-next/src/slices/*/model.json
- CustomTypes:prismic-next/customtypes/*/index.json
- EnvTemplate:prismic-next/.env.example
- HealthScript:prismic-next/scripts/stack_health.sh

EnvValues{set_in_prismic-next/.env}:
- NEXT_PUBLIC_PRISMIC_REPOSITORY_NAME=request
- PRISMIC_ACCESS_TOKEN=(optional_if_private)
- NEXT_PUBLIC_PRISMIC_ENVIRONMENT=(optional_override)
- PRISMIC_WEBHOOK_SECRET=(optional)

PreviewSetup{required}:
- LocalPreviewURL:http://localhost:3000/api/preview
- CloudPreviewURL:https://request-beryl.vercel.app/api/preview
- Note:PreviewURLs_must_use_app_domain_NOT_request.prismic.io

WebhookSetup{optional}:
- URL:https://request-beryl.vercel.app/api/revalidate
- Method:POST
- Header:x-prismic-webhook-secret:PRISMIC_WEBHOOK_SECRET

RecreateTemplate{fast}:
1) Clone_repo
2) cd prismic-next
3) npm install
4) cp .env.example .env
5) npm run dev
6) Open Slice Machine (http://localhost:9999)
7) Push models to Prismic
8) Create documents from docs/content-seed.md

HealthCheck{script}:
- Run: npm run health
- Extending: add checks for /api/preview and /api/revalidate with curl

ComponentManager{optional}:
- Ladle_or_Storybook_for_slice_previews
- Low_setup: Ladel_with_Prismic_slice_rendering_only

MCP{capabilities}:
- Generate_slice_models
- Generate_slice_mocks
- Explain_slice_fields
- Rapid_content_model_refactors
- Suggest_type_safe_component_updates

TokenEfficiency{strategy}:
- Keep_slice_models_small
- Reuse_shared_appearance_fields
- Avoid_duplicate_singletons

FlowChart{stack_sync}:
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Editor[Prismic Editor] -->|Publish| Prismic[Prismic API]
  SliceMachine[Slice Machine] -->|Sync Models| Prismic
  Prismic -->|Fetch| NextApp[Next.js App]
  NextApp -->|Render| Browser[Client Browser]
  Prismic -->|Webhook| Revalidate[/api/revalidate/]
  Revalidate -->|revalidateTag(prismic)| NextCache[Next.js Cache]
  GitHub[GitHub Repo] -->|Deploy| Vercel[Vercel]
  Vercel -->|Serve| NextApp
```
